# Environment
# Copy to .env.local at repo root. Set the same keys when deploying to Vercel.

## Optional - only required for certain features (e.g. case review notifications).

### Resend API key for email notifications.
RESEND_API_KEY=

### Case review from email address.
CASE_REVIEW_FROM_EMAIL=

### Case review notification email address.
CASE_REVIEW_NOTIFY_EMAIL=info@clineapc.com

### Zapier / Make / CRM inbound URL. Leave empty if email-only.
CASE_REVIEW_WEBHOOK_URL=

## Search & measurement (production deployment).

### Canonical origin used for canonicals, sitemap, Open Graph and JSON-LD. Defaults to
### https://www.lemonlawlawyerscalifornia.com; any other request host is served with
### X-Robots-Tag: noindex (see src/proxy.ts), so staging never needs its own value.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=

### Google Tag Manager container (production uses GTM-WXN4B2). Leave empty on staging.
NEXT_PUBLIC_GTM_ID=

### Search Console HTML-tag token (prefer DNS verification; this is a fallback).
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_SITE_VERIFICATION=
